    "body": "Fix round on head f9a0818e (review blocker and notes):\n- The Setup<n> \"Open <name> fixtures\" button now calls browser_pane::focus before actions::target, as the browser's Fixtures row and the Setups page's Open page button do. From an inactive setup it activates it first.\n- New test `tests::setups_declutter::an_inactive_setups_fixtures_button_activates_it_and_opens_its_workholding`: two setups, Setup1 active, clicks Open Setup2 fixtures on the inactive Setup2, asserts Setup2 is active, the Fixtures page is titled for Setup2, it is not refused, and it shows the workholding.\n- The two pointer lines share one wording (setup_pages::WORKHOLDING_POINTER).\n- The decision note now says effort:high and names setup_tree::every_setup_owns_its_nodes_in_order for the implicit rows.\n- Button placement unchanged.\nQuick gate on this head: green on the first run (ui lib, boundary, boundary_picks, theme_files). Still a draft.",
